        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">Cash and Cash Equivalents consists of Temporary Investments (Account 11) of $14,617,027</xhtml:span>.</xhtml:p>
