      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 24px;">Cash and Cash equivalents consists of Cash (Account 10) of $4,884,986 and Temporary Investments (Account 11) of $26,333,639.</xhtml:span>
